            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.56</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Ideogram: style control.</b> Both Ideogram models now offer a style setting (Auto, General, Realistic, Design). For Reframe this is the creative direction, since the model takes no prompt. Reframe also accepts additional images as style references alongside the source.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
